msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Morgana did. Morgana’s soul told me everything!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I am not from this "
"time. I lived in a time after her death—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫모르가나 본인이야……, ⟪k:4⟫그 혼에게 모든 걸 들었어!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫나는 이 시대 인간"
"이 아니라, ⟪k:7⟫모르가나 사후――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3C78C0A5_7A1E_41C1_BDB0_8ED1ABEB53F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eff6e5d723e614265a8eecdcc621a925c4ea7db1d5f2768e1ee0e062ae17d5d9
