msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It takes me several moments"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫무슨 일이 ⟪k:2⟫일어난 건지――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1FF86269_360F_4914_8B89_581C524073DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
