msgid "⟪k:0⟫I twist my head back to see the man on top of me holding my right hand,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 등 위에 올라탄 남자가…… ⟪k:1⟫내 오른손을 잡고――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0DAA5B0C_613C_479B_A7F2_EC1781F90946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
