msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Next up is your ring finger.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And then your middle, if you insist on "
"keeping this up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그래…… 이어서 약지로 가지. ⟪k:3⟫순서대로 해야겠어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BED88B9C_4274_432E_ABD8_5D0E409AA95E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c4b771b325fbff5adc479276b2cc5ff52c9a59742aaabc0db57e595209b5ebc
