msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m telling you the truth!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫She bears so much hatred... ⟪k:6⟫she "
"casts a curse on your souls!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫사실이야……! ⟪k:4⟫모르가나는……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫너희를 오래도록 증오하며――, ⟪k:7⟫그 혼"
"에 저주를 걸어!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AF9638D7_80BD_4A15_B004_34CB497E11D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 435ce557e89ededc2185949393ae661e38f3d65b5cc9fbc670e48d5a507a0df7
#. default-sha256: 0edaa10bec6b3d8677f01feb4549b7d4c61129965e8b83fa09b9514349fb4e88
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AF9638D7_80BD_4A15_B004_34CB497E11D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now you’re resorting to “souls” and “next lives”?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’m genuinely "
"impressed. ⟪k:6⟫What lies are you going to cook up next, white-haired knave?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫혼에다 ⟪k:4⟫내세. ⟪k:5⟫사기꾼이라도 이 지경이면 유쾌하군.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫……자, ⟪k:8⟫"
"또 무슨 허언을 할 거지?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5ECF4693_86D0_4011_A212_CAD19BC7FD1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efcebc24e7cecdccbc345b4cc05e49866e5f8ac215a86d3dfb0c6c41fb1d2359
