msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nrgh... ⟪k:5⟫If I don’t set Morgana free...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫your souls will be "
"enslaved for all eternity!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……윽……, ⟪k:5⟫모르가나를 못 구하면……⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫너희의 혼도 못 풀려나!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A480557E_D5D9_434F_9446_E72F7E4E7E4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08d36d4eb6897b0380e7dc7110095c972b73304f51881964af399d7269477763
