msgid "⟪k:0⟫Imprisoned in this cursed mansion!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 저주받은 저택에서 못 나온다고!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_878731CA_0904_40E5_A759_61E9D6D2F895
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
