msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When the bell tolls noon...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫on the day of the harvest festival...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"you’ll lose everything—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫all of you will!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이 시대에서도―― ⟪k:2⟫축제 날……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫정오 종소리가 울린 후에……, ⟪k:5⟫너희는 모든 걸 "
"잃어!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1926F103_1497_4C4C_A7D0_2669800CF82D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8fb80743b9dc3874f6cf9064c4702a7d9ad4cca6a0dc32798f782eb93be0503
#. default-sha256: 2c63435087b749dac70cfcc8610066133cee2436b4495d4203fa9eb3fabab3df
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1926F103_1497_4C4C_A7D0_2669800CF82D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the nun, the reason you locked Morgana up in the first place, ⟪k:1⟫she won’t be safe "
"either!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네가 모르가나를 유폐하면서까지 지키려던――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫수도녀 또한!"

