msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Continuing to lie isn’t going to make this any easier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Your voice is "
"shaking. The pain’s starting to get to you, isn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫사기를 쳐 봤자 득 볼 거 없는데……?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫아프지……? ⟪k:5⟫목소리가 떨리잖아……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E576E6F5_4B51_46E1_8ACE_4DB12E666EB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
