msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫otherwise your soul—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and the souls of those you care about—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫will be "
"doomed to suffering!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫너는 본인 뿐만 아니라.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫인연이 있는 자의 혼까지 고통받게 해!!"

