msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Nothing I’ve said to you has been a lie—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫some cheap attempt to "
"fool you into letting me go!⟪k:7⟫Every word of it is true!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 네게 하는 모든 말은―― 사기가 아니며,⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫아무 말이나 하는 게 아니"
"야! ⟪k:6⟫모두 사실이야……!"

