msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I know the sins you’ve burdened your soul with—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I know the fate that "
"awaits you in your next life.⟪k:5⟫And I will gladly tell you every detail!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫내가…… 네 혼이 짊어진 업과……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내세에서 거칠 운명을 알려 주지……!"

